{"comment":"Root commands with a stream on the fixture repository ${repo}, whose virtual branch has the commit ${commit}: each event of the channel of the command is x-branch-deck/callEvent with the id of its request, before its answer. Tokens as in repository-channel.ndjson."}
{"client":{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"initialize","params":{"channel":"ahp-root://","protocolVersions":["1.0.0"],"clientId":"corpus","clientInfo":{"name":"branch-deck-ide","build":"${build}"},"_meta":{"x-branch-deck":{"version":"1.0.0","capabilities":{"hostRequests":["openWindow"]}}}}}}
{"host":{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"result":{"protocolVersion":"1.0.0","serverSeq":0,"snapshots":[],"serverInfo":{"name":"branch-deck","build":"${build}"},"_meta":{"x-branch-deck":{"version":"1.0.0"}}}}}
{"comment":"The diffs of a commit: the files, then the content of each file, then the answer of a command without an output."}
{"client":{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":2,"method":"x-branch-deck/get_file_diffs","params":{"channel":"ahp-root://","window":"review-1","args":{"params":{"repositoryPath":"${repo}","source":{"kind":"commit","id":"${commit}"},"policy":"default","priorityPaths":[]}}}}}
{"host":{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"x-branch-deck/callEvent","params":{"channel":"ahp-root://","requestId":2,"event":{"kind":"files","files":"${any}","asksIndex":"${any}"}}}}
{"host":{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"x-branch-deck/callEvent","params":{"channel":"ahp-root://","requestId":2,"event":{"kind":"content","index":0,"content":"${any}","collapse":"${any}","reading":"${any}"}}}}
{"host":{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":2,"result":{"value":null}}}
{"comment":"A raw command answers bytes in base64."}
{"client":{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":3,"method":"x-branch-deck/get_blob_syntax","params":{"channel":"ahp-root://","args":{"params":"${syntaxParams}"}}}}
{"host":{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":3,"result":{"bytes":"${any}"}}}
{"comment":"A command that fails answers its ApiError as its result: a sync of a repository that does not exist."}
{"client":{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":4,"method":"x-branch-deck/sync","params":{"channel":"ahp-root://","window":"main","args":{"params":{"repositoryPath":"${repo}/missing","reason":"manual"}}}}}
{"host":{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":4,"result":{"error":{"code":"${any}","message":"${any}","details":"${any}","retry":"${any}","operation_id":"${any}"}}}}
{"comment":"An intent without a subscription (the undo case): execute of a rename of the virtual branch streams its steps and its done event, and answers its Outcome. No subscription of the connection names its repository, so nothing waits for its version."}
{"client":{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":5,"method":"x-branch-deck/execute","params":{"channel":"ahp-root://","window":"main","args":{"params":{"repositoryPath":"${repo}","intent":"${renameIntent}","fingerprint":"${fingerprint}"}}}}}
{"host":{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"x-branch-deck/callEvent","params":{"channel":"ahp-root://","requestId":5,"event":{"kind":"step","op":"${op}","step":"${any}"}}}}
{"host":{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"x-branch-deck/callEvent","params":{"channel":"ahp-root://","requestId":5,"event":{"kind":"done","outcome":{"op":"${op}","effects":"${any}","newsKey":"${any}","versionAfter":"${any}","result":"${any}","undo":"${any}","stats":"${any}"}}}}}
{"host":{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":5,"result":{"value":{"op":"${op}","effects":"${any}","newsKey":"${any}","versionAfter":"${any}","result":"${any}","undo":"${any}","stats":"${any}"}}}}
{"comment":"The same with a subscription: the viewPatched actions of the rename, the first from the view of the subscribe, come before its done event and its answer, each after the actions up to the version it names (the version fence): the done event the version of the rewrite, the answer the version after the sync that follows it. Its step events and the patches the session sends of its own between the lines (the operation in the view, a fact read again) have no order of their own against them: the runner passes over them."}
{"client":{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":6,"method":"x-branch-deck/repositoryChannel","params":{"channel":"ahp-root://","repositoryPath":"${repo}"}}}
{"host":{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":6,"result":{"channel":"x-branch-deck:/repository/1"}}}
{"client":{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":7,"method":"subscribe","params":{"channel":"x-branch-deck:/repository/1","_meta":{"x-branch-deck":{"window":"main"}}}}}
{"host":{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":7,"result":{"snapshot":{"resource":"x-branch-deck:/repository/1","state":"${view0}","fromSeq":0}}}}
{"client":{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":8,"method":"x-branch-deck/execute","params":{"channel":"ahp-root://","window":"main","args":{"params":{"repositoryPath":"${repo}","intent":"${renameBackIntent}","fingerprint":"${fingerprint2}"}}}}}
{"host":{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"action","params":{"channel":"x-branch-deck:/repository/1","action":{"type":"x-branch-deck/viewPatched","patch":{"base":"${view0.version}","next":"${any}","changes":"${any}"}},"window":"main","serverSeq":1}}}
{"host":{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"x-branch-deck/callEvent","params":{"channel":"ahp-root://","requestId":8,"event":{"kind":"done","outcome":{"op":"${op2}","effects":"${any}","newsKey":"${any}","versionAfter":"${v1}","result":"${any}","undo":"${any}","stats":"${any}"}}}}}
{"host":{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":8,"result":{"value":{"op":"${op2}","effects":"${any}","newsKey":"${any}","versionAfter":"${v2}","result":"${any}","undo":"${any}","stats":"${any}"}}}}
{"comment":"A cancel of a stream: the call gets one answer, and no event of it after the answer."}
{"client":{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":9,"method":"x-branch-deck/get_file_diffs","params":{"channel":"ahp-root://","window":"review-1","args":{"params":{"repositoryPath":"${repo}","source":{"kind":"uncommitted"},"policy":"default","priorityPaths":[]}}}}}
{"client":{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"x-branch-deck/cancel","params":{"channel":"ahp-root://","requestId":9}}}
{"host":{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":9,"result":"${any}"}}
{"client":{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":10,"method":"ping","params":{"channel":"ahp-root://"}}}
{"host":{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":10,"result":{}}}
